'''Invasion of the Swamplord''' (三途の沼のヌシ大降臨, ''Sanzu no Numa no Nushi Daikōrin'', '''Lord of the Sanzu Swamp Great Advent''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] and appears on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]]. The first three stages yield nothing when completed, while the final stage drops the unit [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]].

