==Trivia==
*The Sanzu Swamp in Invasion of the Swamplord's Japanese name is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Sanzu River|Sanzu River]], a river in Japanese Buddhist tradition which the souls of the deceased must cross before they can reach the afterlife.
*"Ghost" is a translation of 妖怪 ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'', a class of supernatural creatures and phenomena in Japanese folklore. The ''[[wikipedia:Kappa (folklore)|kappa]]'' is an example of a ''yōkai''.
*The English event banner mistakenly states that [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] is Strong against [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies instead of Resistant to them.

